WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:05.149
Identify, explain and apply the important ideas behind use file explorer.

00:00:05.950 --> 00:00:11.976
File Explorer: helps browse computer files and folders. Navigation pane: lists useful

00:00:11.976 --> 00:00:12.478
locations.

00:00:13.283 --> 00:00:19.565
Search box: helps find a named item. Storage drive: holds saved digital information.

00:00:19.565 --> 00:00:22.947
Recycle Bin: temporarily holds many deleted files.

00:00:23.783 --> 00:00:27.999
With an adult supervising, practise file explorer and navigation pane using a

00:00:27.999 --> 00:00:32.917
computer if one is available. Without a computer, draw the screen and explain each

00:00:32.917 --> 00:00:34.322
step to a partner.
